## 16. YAML Front-Matter Standard

All MDD markdown documents should include front-matter for agent filtering:

```yaml
---
document_type: [PLAN | DEBUG | COMPLETION | STATE | PROMPT | SKILL | GOVERNANCE]
status: [DRAFT | ACTIVE | APPROVED | DEPRECATED]
reviewer:
  accountable: "[person or role]"
compliance_tags: ["tag1", "tag2"]
traceability_id: "[ticket-id or plan-ref]"
---
```

Agents must respect `document_type` and `status` when selecting context.

