## 17. Git Conventions

### Standard commits
```
feat(scope): [summary]
fix(scope): [summary]
docs(scope): [summary]
refactor(scope): [summary]
```

### Phase commits
```
feat(pipeline): Phase XX - [summary]
- [Key deliverable 1]
- [Key deliverable 2]
- [Validation results]
```

### Partial / blocked work
```
WIP: Phase XX partial - [what's done]
- [Completed items]
- [Blocked on: specific issue]
```

Attach `traceability_id` (JIRA, GitHub issue) when available.
